    (&quot;/&quot; &quot;Great! If so, let me know.\nNow I go, I've already wasted all morning out here waiting for you.\nCome and see me at the Vantoi Lab whenever you want.\nDo you remember where it is? Southeast of the Xeonjia Tower.\nBye!&quot;)
